Task: Add OrderStatus.Confirmed and PaymentFailed cases + tests (US-6.3 Phase 1)

Summary: Extended the closed OrderStatus ADT with two new terminal cases -
Confirmed ('confirmed') and PaymentFailed ('payment_failed') - needed to
represent the outcome of payment-service's payment.settled/payment.failed
events. Both asString and fromString updated; fromString's error path is
unaffected (still rejects any other string).

Files changed:
- src/main/scala/orderservice/OrderStatus.scala
- src/test/scala/orderservice/OrderStatusSuite.scala

Why: US-6.3 needs a target status to transition an order to once a payment
settles or fails. These two cases are the DB/Scala-level groundwork; the
CHECK constraint migration and the actual transition logic come next in
this phase.
